    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THERE\u2019S ALWAYS A FASTER LINE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Initial Delivery\u00a0</i>is an arcade rally where every run brings a fresh experience. The procedural track generator means that every day brings new twists, shortcuts, obstacles, and a new chance to be crowned the champion before the timer hits zero and a fresh seed takes over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated rally tracks. No two random runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotating \u2018featured\u2019 runs, with global shared leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risky but rewarding shortcuts-in case you want to take your chances off road</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based sim-cade driving mechanics that are fun yet realistic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Wishlist today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
